19
00:00:28.864 --> 00:00:29.697
No pads.

20
00:00:29.697 --> 00:00:30.530
[Conan] No pads?

21
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.363
[Nick] No pads.

22
00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:32.196
