24
00:00:33.029 --> 00:00:33.862
It's like a field goal.

25
00:00:33.862 --> 00:00:35.400
Kick the ball between the goals.

26
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.233
Okay.

27
00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:37.066
I should point out,

28
00:00:37.066 --> 00:00:37.949
