39
00:00:51.015 --> 00:00:51.848
That's alright.

40
00:00:51.848 --> 00:00:52.681
Neither do the players, too.
I didn't hear a single word.

41
00:00:52.681 --> 00:00:54.480
I've played quite a bit of football in my day.

42
00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.897
It looks like it.

43
00:00:57.832 --> 00:00:59.912
I find that a bit sarcastic, but I'm gonna take it.

44
00:00:59.912 --> 00:01:00.750
Alright.
That's fine.

45
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:05.080
The other thing in AFL is, there's no sleeves on our jersey.

46
